{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7304f500-9df5-81e0-918a-0377f68e5bb1",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:31:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about a pothole. Well, it was a pothole. Somebody patched it last week, and the patch is already gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, I wrote it down. [pause] Okay. It's in front of 226 Spring Street. That's in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "226 Spring Street. And you said somebody patched it last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It was the cold patch stuff, the black gravel. It looked fine for a few days. Then we had that rain over the weekend and it washed right out. It's a hole again, same as before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the cold patch from last week washed out and the hole is back. Is it in the travel lane or near the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, let me think. It's toward the middle of the lane, a little off the curb. Cars are swerving around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, middle of the lane. Do you know roughly how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About, I'd say a foot and a half across. Maybe four or five inches deep. I didn't measure it, I just looked at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, one thing. I can hear my own voice echoing back on this call. It's kind of distracting. Can you hear that on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't hear an echo on mine. It might be your phone. If you hold it away from your ear a bit, or switch off speaker if you have it on, that sometimes helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me try that. [pause] That's a little better. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. One more question. Is this a street buses use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's on a bus route. The bus goes right over that spot. I see it dip every time it goes by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, I'll put that in the notes. So that's 226 Spring Street, a foot and a half wide, about four or five inches deep, middle of the lane, on a bus route, and the cold patch from last week washed out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll send this to the street crew as a repeat repair. Can I get a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Joel Fortes. F-O-R-T-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Fortes. I've got you entered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a reference number for this? So I can say which report it is if I call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, it's showing as request 4471. Do you want me to read it again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Let me get a pen. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one. Got it. Do you know when somebody will get out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It usually takes a few days to a week. Repeat repairs like this one are sometimes moved up, but it depends on the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's fine. I just wanted it on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on record now. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
